<title>USA: Community Financial to acquire bank.</title>
<headline>Community Financial to acquire bank.</headline>
<dateline>OLNEY, Ill. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Financial Corp said Friday it has signed an agreement to acquire American Bancshares Inc for cash not exceeding $2.15 million.</p>
<p>American Bancshares is the holding company for American Bank of Illinois in Highland, which has assets of $18 million, Community Financial said.</p>
<p>The acquisition would result in consolidated assets for Community Financial of about $203.3 million, the bank said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be completed in the second quarter of 1997, the bank said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
